[TEXT] **Root cause found!** Router6 has **iptables FORWARD chain DROP rules** that block all transit traffic:

```
ACCEPT  tcp  172.16.10.0/24  →  172.18.51.1  dpt:80   (only exception)
DROP    tcp  any  →  any
DROP    udp  any  →  any
DROP    0    any  →  any   (catches ICMP and all else)
```

And router6 itself can ping 192.168.200.13 (0% loss) — the ACL only blocks **forwarded** traffic, not self-originated. This perfectly explains the fault family.
